.SH BUGS
No server in the tree answers
.BR Tsymlink ,
.BR Tmknod ,
.BR Trename ,
.BR Treadlink ,
.BR Txattrwalk ,
.BR Txattrcreate ,
.BR Tlock ,
.BR Tgetlock ,
.BR Tlink ,
.B Trenameat
or
.B Tunlinkat
with success.
Each comes back
.B Rlerror
with
.B EOPNOTSUPP,
or
.B EPERM
where the request would have created or removed a file
in a tree that does not allow it.
There is no rename; a caller copies and removes.
There are no hard or symbolic links, and no advisory locks.
